---
import ExperienceIcon from '../assets/icons/solid/experience.svg';
---

<div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
  <div class="card-body">
    <h2 class="card-title text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <ExperienceIcon class="h-7 w-7 shrink-0 fill-primary" />
      Experience
    </h2>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-4">
      <div
        class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-0.5">
            <h1 class="text-lg font-medium">Cohesity, Pune</h1>
            <h2 class="text-base-content/70">Member of Technical Staff III</h2>
            <h2 class="text-base-content/70">December 2024 - Present</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
            Continuing to lead technical initiatives and Scrum team operations
            following Cohesity's acquisition of Veritas Technologies.
            Maintaining continuity in product development while integrating into
            Cohesity's engineering culture and contributing to their data
            management platform.
          </p>
          <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
            <li>
              Leading a cross-functional Scrum team of 7 developers through full
              sprint cycles
            </li>
            <li>
              Architecting and implementing scalable full-stack features for
              enterprise customers
            </li>
            <li>
              Driving technical decisions and mentoring team members on best
              practices
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-0.5">
            <h1 class="text-lg font-medium">Veritas Technologies LLC, Pune</h1>
            <h2 class="text-base-content/70">Senior Software Engineer</h2>
            <h2 class="text-base-content/70">August 2020 - December 2024</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
            Led development of NetInsights, a comprehensive web dashboard for
            Veritas Appliance customers, while simultaneously managing a Scrum
            team and mentoring junior developers.
          </p>
          <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
            <li>
              <strong>Team Leadership:</strong> Led a Scrum team of 7 developers
              for 2 years, conducting sprint planning, daily standups, and retrospectives
              while maintaining 95%+ sprint completion rate
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Product Development:</strong> Architected and developed NetInsights
              dashboard using Angular 12, serving thousands of enterprise customers
              with real-time appliance monitoring and management capabilities
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Mentorship Impact:</strong> Mentored 4 junior developers, guiding
              them through code reviews, pair programming sessions, and architectural
              discussions, resulting in their progression to mid-level roles
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Full-Stack Innovation:</strong> Designed and built an internal
              customer-facing application from scratch, creating UX mockups, implementing
              frontend with modern frameworks, and developing robust backend APIs
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Performance Optimization:</strong> Improved dashboard load
              times by 40% through code splitting, lazy loading, and efficient state
              management
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Cross-functional Collaboration:</strong> Worked closely with
              product managers, UX designers, and customer success teams to translate
              business requirements into technical solutions
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-0.5">
            <h1 class="text-lg font-medium">Ecozen Solutions, Pune</h1>
            <h2 class="text-base-content/70">Full Stack Web Developer</h2>
            <h2 class="text-base-content/70">September 2019 - August 2020</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
            Developed end-to-end IoT data management platform for monitoring and
            controlling agricultural IoT devices deployed across multiple farms.
          </p>
          <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
            <li>
              <strong>IoT Dashboard:</strong> Built real-time monitoring dashboard
              using Vue.js, displaying data from 100+ IoT devices with live updates
              and interactive visualizations
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Backend Architecture:</strong> Designed and implemented RESTful
              APIs using Node.js with TypeScript, handling 10,000+ API requests daily
              with 99.9% uptime
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>MQTT Integration:</strong> Developed MQTT client for real-time
              data ingestion from IoT devices, processing and storing time-series
              data in MongoDB
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Automated Monitoring:</strong> Created CRON jobs with email
              notification system to alert operators of device anomalies, reducing
              response time to critical issues by 60%
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Data Pipeline:</strong> Built ETL pipeline to parse, validate,
              and store sensor data from heterogeneous IoT devices
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-0.5">
            <h1 class="text-lg font-medium">Advinans, Stockholm, Sweden</h1>
            <h2 class="text-base-content/70">Backend Developer</h2>
            <h2 class="text-base-content/70">September 2018 - August 2019</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
            Developed automated deployment infrastructure for containerized
            applications on Google Cloud Platform.
          </p>
          <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
            <li>
              <strong>DevOps Automation:</strong> Built intelligent Slackbot that
              automated Docker container deployments to Kubernetes clusters, reducing
              deployment time from 30 minutes to 2 minutes
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Cloud Functions:</strong> Implemented serverless deployment
              logic using Google Cloud Functions with TypeScript, handling authentication,
              validation, and orchestration
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Kubernetes Integration:</strong> Designed deployment pipelines
              that interfaced with GKE (Google Kubernetes Engine) APIs for zero-downtime
              deployments
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Developer Experience:</strong> Improved team productivity by
              enabling developers to deploy applications directly from Slack with
              simple commands
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-0.5">
            <h1 class="text-lg font-medium">
              TallBird Employment Innovations, Pune
            </h1>
            <h2 class="text-base-content/70">Full Stack Developer</h2>
            <h2 class="text-base-content/70">January 2018 - December 2018</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
            Built modern web applications for early-stage startup in the HR
            technology space, focusing on progressive web applications and
            serverless architecture.
          </p>
          <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
            <li>
              <strong>Progressive Web App:</strong> Designed and developed PWA using
              React.js with offline capabilities, push notifications, and app-like
              experience, achieving 90+ Lighthouse score
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Serverless Backend:</strong> Architected complete backend infrastructure
              on Firebase, utilizing Cloud Functions for business logic and Cloud
              Firestore for real-time data synchronization
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>UI/UX Design:</strong> Created responsive, mobile-first interfaces
              with focus on user experience and accessibility
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Rapid Prototyping:</strong> Worked in fast-paced startup environment,
              iterating quickly based on user feedback and business requirements
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-0.5">
            <h1 class="text-lg font-medium">Accenture, Mumbai Area</h1>
            <h2 class="text-base-content/70">Associate Software Engineer</h2>
            <h2 class="text-base-content/70">October 2013 - September 2015</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
            Worked as SAP ABAP developer on enterprise client projects, ensuring
            system stability and performance.
          </p>
          <ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-sm text-base-content/70 space-y-1">
            <li>
              Developed and maintained SAP ABAP programs for core business
              processes
            </li>
            <li>
              Resolved production defects and incidents with quick turnaround
              times
            </li>
            <li>
              Troubleshot and optimized SAP Batch Jobs to improve processing
              efficiency
            </li>
            <li>
              Collaborated with functional consultants to translate business
              requirements into technical specifications
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
